OL,3,GNEWSABurnham - Rosebank and Jackdaw
OL,4,Adecisions coming 'shortly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said a
OL,7,Fdecision on whether to give the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead to two oil and gas fields will
OL,9,Fbe made "shortly".
OL,11,FParties at Westminster are calling for
OL,12,FBurnham to approve plans for Rosebank,
OL,13,Fan oil field off Shetland, and gas
OL,14,Ffield Jackdaw, east of Aberdeen.
OL,16,FThe controversial fields have been the
OL,17,Fsubject of years of debates, legal
OL,18,Fwrangling and public consultations,
OL,19,Fwith arguments from both industry
OL,20,Fbodies and environmentalists being
OL,21,Fweighed up by the UK government.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
