OL,3,GNEWSABurnham - Rosebank and Jackdaw
OL,4,Adecisions coming 'shortly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at Prime Minister's Questions,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch urged
OL,8,FBurnham "to stop faffing about" when it
OL,9,Fcomes to the North Sea drilling.
